  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Marble Tulip Juicy Tree** (1 review): The solo in this song is rated better than most others [4]\n- **Going Gets Tough (2 failed attempts)** (1 other source): Setlist notes this song took two failed attempts before it was played [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **love will conquer all**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [8]\n- **Stacey**: rare: 7 archived performances [8]\n- **Reggae Junky Jew**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [8]\n- **The Wind**: rare: 6 archived performances [8]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Going Gets Tough (2 failed attempts) [8]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween1991-10-12.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 58 min; rated 4.5/5 by 6 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Between songs, the performer jokes he is like Jerry Garcia on a night when his voice is gone but he still rocks [4]\n- Video of most of this show circulates on YouTube and other sites [5]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween1991-10-12.flac16**: transferred by ripped by eyeh8ewe, tracked by kliked; source: Hi8 master > Mac G5 > iDVD [1]. Also: A DVD version of the concert is available to download from the Internet Archive; Source is the original Hi8 master tape, transferred via Mac G5 and iDVD, with no tweaking of any kind; Filmed with a Hi8 camcorder at the stage edge; DVD was ripped, converted from 48 to 44.1 kHz, faded, and saved as wav by eyeh8ewe [1][6]",
